"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the Aeroplan award leaving SFO at 11:15 p.m. on January 15: among the shown awards, it has the shortest elapsed journey, arrives at 10:35 a.m. on January 17, and reports two seats. The tradeoff is that another shown award arrives earlier, and this quote does not establish an all-in price.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J1@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T10:35\",\"n\":\"Recommendation: shorter journey and two reported seats\",\"v\":\"Aeroplan economy award, one stop via Hong Kong, arriving January 17 at 10:35 a.m. Listed at 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 107.40 in fees; the fee quote scope is unknown. The record reports two seats. Economy is the reported award cabin, but individual-leg cabins are unspecified.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Compared with the other late-evening Aeroplan option below, this arrives 6 hours 15 minutes earlier and takes 6 hours less elapsed time, while departing just 15 minutes earlier. That alternative reports one seat. This recommendation is a useful fit if the reported seat count and shorter trip matter more than arriving earlier in the day.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T02\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T03\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J13@2027-01-15T23:30-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T16:50\",\"n\":\"Similar departure, later arrival\",\"v\":\"Aeroplan economy award via Taipei, arriving January 17 at 4:50 p.m. It lists 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 116.50 in fees, with unknown quote scope, and reports one seat. Its 8-hour-15-minute connection at Taipei and later arrival are downsides; consider it if its particular schedule or routing suits you better.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"If reaching Bangkok earlier matters more than the shortest trip, consider the midday-departing award. It arrives at 1:25 a.m. on January 17, but its total elapsed time is longer than the recommendation’s.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J7@2027-01-15T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T01:25\",\"n\":\"Earlier arrival, midday departure\",\"v\":\"Aeroplan economy award via Taipei, departing January 15 at noon and arriving January 17 at 1:25 a.m. It lists 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 116.50 in fees, with unknown quote scope, and reports one seat. It gets you in 9 hours 10 minutes before the recommendation, but takes 2 hours 5 minutes longer overall and requires an earlier departure.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T06\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There is also a later-arriving Aeroplan choice with one reported seat; its schedule is less appealing if early arrival or a shorter journey is your priority.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J11@2027-01-15T23:30-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T23:40\",\"n\":\"Late arrival, long connection\",\"v\":\"Aeroplan economy award via Taipei, arriving January 17 at 11:40 p.m. It lists 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 116.50 in fees, with unknown quote scope, and reports one seat. The 15-hour-5-minute Taipei connection and late arrival are downsides; this timing may suit you if those tradeoffs work for your plans.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T08\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline: Singapore Airlines\",\"v\":\"The shown cash itinerary departs SFO at 9:40 a.m. January 15 and arrives in Bangkok at 8:25 a.m. January 17, with one stop and 31 hours 45 minutes elapsed. The quoted fare is USD 440.00; its quote scope is unknown, so it cannot be treated as a per-traveler or all-in total.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Shared limits: each award reports economy at the award level, but cabin for each individual leg is unspecified. Award fee quote scopes are unknown, as is the cash fare scope; listed points and fees therefore do not establish confirmed totals for you or your party. The cash fare is a separate baseline, not a like-for-like total-cost comparison. Search results may not be real-time, so confirm current award availability and prices with the booking provider. The search reports 258 eligible journey choices, but these selected examples are not the full inventory; provider coverage was partial, with some route and date detail checks omitted.\"}]}"
